<section class="section"><div class="container content-grid"><div class="prose"><h2>A shared educational journey</h2><p>SWEEP Schools brings together SWEEP Kidz Pre-School and SWEEP Academy Primary School. The existing school message focuses on helping children grow, develop and achieve their true potential in spirit, soul and body.</p><p>The school’s published values emphasise a loving and safe environment, a stimulating and friendly atmosphere, respect and sensitivity towards others, individual development, and close relationships between parents, children and staff.</p><h2>A Christian foundation</h2><p>Christian principles are a central part of the school’s stated educational philosophy. The primary school’s published vision references Jeremiah 17:8, while SWEEP Kidz references Matthew 19:14. These references and their presentation should be reviewed by the school before final publication.</p><h2>Our people</h2><p>The existing website includes information about the principal and school teams. Current staff names, roles, biographies and photographs should be added here only after they have been verified and approved by the school.</p></div><aside class="info-card"><h3>Visit or contact us</h3><p>4 Burger Street, corner Burger and Swartgoud Streets<br />Suideroord, Johannesburg, 2091</p><p><a href="tel:+27116805938">011 680 5938</a><br /><a href="mailto:schools@sweeplife.co.za">schools@sweeplife.co.za</a></p><a class="button" href="/contact/">Contact SWEEP <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></aside></div></section>
